  "prototypeNotes": [
    "The dependency graph is package-owned and contains no Werewolf-specific code requirement in Chronicle Core.",
    "The graph distinguishes deterministic derived-value recalculation from user-selection invalidation.",
    "Classification changes require preview when dependent state may change.",
    "Affected-field validation uses forward transitive closure through this graph.",
    "The graph is acyclic because it models causal order, not user navigation.",
    "Chronicle owns artifact discovery, version checks, state persistence, transactions, and preview fingerprints.",
    "The Rule Set owns dependency semantics, conditional edges, recalculation rules, and invalidation triggers."
